  "instance_name": "online_stress_culture",
  "label": "Online Stress Culture",
  "description": "The image and text reference a common modern phenomenon: the overwhelming pressure and frustration experienced when dealing with digital tasks, such as work emails, social media, or complex software. This is often amplified by the 'always-on' nature of digital life, leading to feelings of being overwhelmed or 'victimized' by technology or digital environments. The laptop is a symbol of this digital stress.",
